<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is expanding its security and trade measures, adding the AI firm Megaspeed to a US export control list and planning bans on chemicals linked to Myanmar rare-earth mining, while also promoting cross-border rail freight and border trade to access global markets. Police uncovered a murder room in a gruesome dismemberment case involving a Burmese suspect, and Thai forces reported Ukrainian Oplot tanks performing better than Chinese VT‑4s in local clashes. Environmental pressure is rising as Thai officials call for international cooperation on cross-border river pollution and groups in Chiang Rai demand action, reflecting heightened focus on both security and ecological issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/23/megaspeed-us-trade-blacklist-nvidia&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/24/us-adds-megaspeed-firm-at-centre-of-nvidia-scandal-to-export-control-list?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cv98xpg5dg5zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5OMC1oVEZuUlVrekNKZ2l4WkItWDVCN0VfX2VfWXNYQVN5MXZ6MjVVeFVZdmJ2Yi1GX2hHQV9tcWN1anpLUkZhRmlibXNpY2VDUXE0OVV3d1NidHRBcXJlUG01UWpMY09uaGk5RlFRSGhSLUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chiang Rai Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNMGxyR0lVdTlIX2tkNU0wVzVmVnBUaEcxZ0FsRVlqVnNvbFBvdE8tcDJWQ0ZSbW9jUFdob21vQWJabUFOWUh1OFVyTlBSc1ZFbFc2S0pncDZ6dDVpNzkwbDRudGlPMm9lLTdpd3NVZ1IyUXl3SHJkM1plZDljVVV3RU5IX2E0UWpLQUdrYkZHZThTbThKcllrMk9pSndrdTBiaUhlVmRVZVR4dw?o